    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Ship on Wheels</strong>, an explosive arcade racing game blending speed, creativity, and competition! Join thrilling official seasons, create your own custom experiences, or face off against friends online in exciting modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000130/extras/36d865027b2688dfb325ec1824312a87.poster.avif?t=1751319903\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000130/extras/36d865027b2688dfb325ec1824312a87.webm?t=1751319903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000130/extras/36d865027b2688dfb325ec1824312a87.mp4?t=1751319903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Official Seasons</strong>: Dive into intense races on meticulously designed tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Creations</strong>: Design your own race tracks or unique arenas filled with captivating mini-games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Mode</strong>: Challenge your friends or players worldwide in fast-paced online races.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle Royale</strong>: Enter a survival mode where you must eliminate your opponents to be the last one standing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community Sharing</strong>: Showcase your creations to the world and explore tracks made by other players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible Gameplay</strong>: Simple and intuitive controls for instant fun, no matter your skill level.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience <strong>Ship on Wheels</strong>: an explosive mix of speed, challenge, and creativity. Start your engines, face your rivals, and prove who\u2019s the king of the track!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Ship on Wheels</strong>, an explosive arcade racing game blending speed, creativity, and competition! Join thrilling official seasons, create your own custom experiences, or face off against friends online in exciting modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000130/extras/36d865027b2688dfb325ec1824312a87.poster.avif?t=1751319903\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000130/extras/36d865027b2688dfb325ec1824312a87.webm?t=1751319903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000130/extras/36d865027b2688dfb325ec1824312a87.mp4?t=1751319903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Official Seasons</strong>: Dive into intense races on meticulously designed tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Creations</strong>: Design your own race tracks or unique arenas filled with captivating mini-games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Mode</strong>: Challenge your friends or players worldwide in fast-paced online races.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle Royale</strong>: Enter a survival mode where you must eliminate your opponents to be the last one standing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community Sharing</strong>: Showcase your creations to the world and explore tracks made by other players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible Gameplay</strong>: Simple and intuitive controls for instant fun, no matter your skill level.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience <strong>Ship on Wheels</strong>: an explosive mix of speed, challenge, and creativity. Start your engines, face your rivals, and prove who\u2019s the king of the track!</p>",
